// @vibe/compiler/entry/source_compile/gc_only — the wasm-gc backend's
// single-source compile driver (lex+parse+check+compile via
// compile_wasi_module_gc, mirroring ../source_compile's linear-backend
// compile_source_wasi) (ADR-0070 Phase 3, #897, compiler-internal batch).
// Compiled into the compiler itself via compiler_sources_manifest.tsv
// (group `entry`, dual-row: this contract + gc_only.vibe).
//
// The old index.vibe was not a facade but the whole implementation (the
// package is single-file), so it moved verbatim to gc_only.vibe. No
// exported types: no struct/enum this package touches. No `version`
// binding existed (compiler-internal package).

